Weighted structure selection
For each valid structure candidate, compute:
\[ W_i=B_i \times D_i \times P_i \times R_i \]
Where:
	•	\(B_i\) = biome compatibility.
	•	\(D_i\) = distance and spacing modifier.
	•	\(P_i\) = pacing modifier.
	•	\(R_i\) = progression or regional relevance.
Normalize the eligible weights and select an archetype using the structure seed.
