5. Randomized Interior Layout System
5.1 Modular Interior Kit
Build interiors using reusable, grid-compatible room modules rather than constructing a new handcrafted layout for every generated structure.
Recommended room dimensions should align to a common spatial grid. For example, a 2 m base grid can support 4 m, 8 m, and 12 m room spans, with larger halls using predefined footprints.
