8. Night 5: The Pursuit
8.1 Event Identity
Name: The Pursuit Frequency: Every fifth night Role: A major cooperative survival encounter that temporarily changes the game's rules.
The Pursuit is a mechanical or anomalous entity that emerges behind the train and follows the railway at dangerous speed. It is not an ordinary enemy that happens to have more health. It is a moving set-piece encounter designed around train operation, weapon positioning, repairs, and team coordination.
The 15 m safe-zone rule is suspended for the duration of the event. The train provides protection from ordinary threats, but it does not protect players from the pursuing entity's event-specific attacks.
Make the change explicit before the encounter begins. Players should never discover that an established safe-zone guarantee has disappeared without warning.
