Mounted weapon gameplay requirements
	•	The operator can physically enter and leave the mount.
	•	Aim movement is constrained by traverse and elevation limits.
	•	Firing produces recoil, vibration, muzzle flash and impact effects.
	•	Ammunition is a real train inventory item.
	•	Reloading blocks firing and requires the appropriate reload action.
