	•	The entity can have exposed weak points during specific attacks without becoming permanently vulnerable throughout the encounter.
Train defense zones
Distribute defensive modules across the train's length rather than allowing every weapon to cover the same narrow field of view.
The locomotive may carry a forward utility mount, while rear cars host heavier defensive systems that cover the pursuer. A central defensive car provides an advantageous firing arc but competes with storage or production modules for space.
This creates meaningful construction decisions before Night 5.
