10.5 Welding Torch and Manual Hull Repairs
The welding torch should be a separate first-person tool with an equipment model, consumable resource, heat effect, audio, and repair validation.
Repair workflow
	1	The player equips the welding torch.
	2	The player approaches a damaged, compatible train module.
	3	The target's damaged area becomes highlighted.
	4	The torch is activated.
	5	Welding sparks and repair-progress feedback begin.
	6	Repair progress accumulates while the player maintains a valid target.
	7	The server verifies consumables, tool condition, repair target, and repair rate.
	8	The damaged component's integrity increases.
	9	The tool consumes fuel or welding rods as defined by the recipe.
