    LocalObjectID
When a generated structure loads, the server checks whether persistent state exists for its ID.
	•	No saved state: Initialize from deterministic generation.
	•	Existing saved state: Apply the saved state.
	•	Partially changed state: Replay validated journal entries.
	•	Incompatible save version: Run a migration or reject the incompatible state safely.
The same crate must never generate a fresh set of loot simply because a player traveled away and returned.
